# Agent Context Linter ownership policy
#
# IMPORTANT: @agent-context-lint/* entries are syntactically valid placeholders.
# They are not an operational control until replaced and verified as described in
# docs/governance/ownership.md. Remote merge/release automation must remain
# disabled while any placeholder is unresolved.
#
# Last matching pattern wins. Cross-domain and two-person approvals are enforced
# by the review matrix and the required governance/review-policy status check.

# Safe default: every otherwise-unmatched path has a maintainer owner.
* @agent-context-lint/maintainers

